Z||000008||Mach10||12-06-2001||08:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by REDHOTT88:<BR><B>That was nice... but I'm a little cynical, if he was in all those places, why didn't he do ANYTHING other than watch?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Because it's our problem, not His. Or, Everything has a reason. Or...<P>Loaded question. No-one can say for certain. But apparantly we're supposed to sort out our own problems. I think this would qualify, don't you?<P>||||reg||12
